{"id":"n60097-2-4","stage":0,"title":"괜찮다 · 没关系","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n60097-2-4-1","ko":"식사 안 하셔도 괜찮으시겠어요?","zh":"您不用吃饭也没关系吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"식사","meaning":"用餐，就餐，餐","explanation":"식사：用餐，就餐，餐。","readings":[{"term":"식사","audio":"/audio/0f82e313dadba4d88a0a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29596","senseId":"1","lemma":"식사","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"식사","audio":"/audio/0f82e313dadba4d88a0a.mp3"}},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不。","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}},{"text":"하셔도","meaning":"吃（饭）也","explanation":"식사하다 表示吃饭；-셔- 尊敬对方，-어도 表示“即使……也”；与前面的 안 合用是不吃饭。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하셔도","audio":"/audio/ac53853df4aeb79c63fa.mp3"}},{"text":"괜찮으시겠어요?","meaning":"可以吗、没关系吗","explanation":"괜찮다：没关系；-으시겠어요? 礼貌地询问对方是否能接受不吃饭。","readings":[{"term":"괜찮다","audio":"/audio/b9a2699f824000e36e45.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60097","senseId":"2","lemma":"괜찮다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"괜찮으시겠어요","audio":"/audio/d038ce578470cdf21e73.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"0f82e313dadba4d8","term":"식사","zh":"用餐，就餐，餐","audio":"/audio/0f82e313dadba4d88a0a.mp3","entryId":"29596","definition":"像早餐、午餐、晚餐那样每天在固定时间吃饭；或指那时吃的食物。","pronunciation":["식싸"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"71372","definition":"表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做；与 식사 合用指吃饭","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"做；与 식사 合用指吃饭","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"b9a2699f824000e3","term":"괜찮다","zh":"没关系、没有问题","audio":"/audio/b9a2699f824000e36e45.mp3","entryId":"60097","definition":"没关系、没有问题","pronunciation":["괜찬타"]}],"audio":"/audio/ae0a7223ea4984e13490.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n60097-2-4-2","ko":"응. 점심을 많이 먹었어.","zh":"嗯，我中午已经吃了很多了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응.","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行。","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}},{"text":"점심을","meaning":"中饭，午饭，午餐","explanation":"점심：中饭，午饭，午餐；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"점심","audio":"/audio/12cf30d1ce4feda7a77d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70868","senseId":"1","lemma":"점심","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"점심을","audio":"/audio/995779c1209c18f09c54.mp3"}},{"text":"많이","meaning":"多","explanation":"많이：多。","readings":[{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66030","senseId":"1","lemma":"많이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}},{"text":"먹었어.","meaning":"吃","explanation":"먹다：吃；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"먹다","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58272","senseId":"1","lemma":"먹다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"먹었어","audio":"/audio/6eb91d9162c5686b3840.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"107dd01c3d38a368","term":"응","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3","entryId":"30205","definition":"用于肯定回答对方所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["응"]},{"id":"12cf30d1ce4feda7","term":"점심","zh":"中饭，午饭，午餐","audio":"/audio/12cf30d1ce4feda7a77d.mp3","entryId":"70868","definition":"早餐和晚餐之间，白天吃的饭。","pronunciation":["점ː심"]},{"id":"1af2aeb1be04021c","term":"많이","zh":"多","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3","entryId":"66030","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准地。","pronunciation":["마ː니"]},{"id":"9639f892bdddb53f","term":"먹다","zh":"吃","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3","entryId":"58272","definition":"将食物送进口中并咽下。","pronunciation":["먹따"]}],"audio":"/audio/5bf443077953fdd225ec.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":1.3,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=60097","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"초급","day":12,"sequenceScore":0.3028,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["您还没有吃饭吗？","您不用吃饭也没关系吧？","您现在吃饭会不舒服吗？"],"answer":1,"explanation":"안 하셔도 괜찮으시겠어요 问即使不吃饭也可以吗，-아/어도 表示即使。"},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["嗯，我中午还没有吃。","嗯，我早上已经吃了很多了。","嗯，我中午已经吃了很多了。"],"answer":2,"explanation":"점심 是午饭，많이 먹었어 是已经吃了很多。"}]}
